From bb71e5ce38ec1d76c38d339842d9e17427619b5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RDoom <171243930+aeon1911@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:03:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 15/47] RDoom: built-in launcher, fixed SD home, Mesa 26 SDK
 linkage, session report.

- RDoom.nro shows the RDoom launcher (../launcher) before the engine starts and
  passes the chosen profile's command line; on hardware quitting returns to it.
- Data lives in sdmc:/switch/rdoom; logs/engine.log, boot.log and
  engine-session.txt record start-up, renderer and Vulkan steps.
- Links the Mesa 26.2.4 Horizon SDK (NVK + EGL/GL/GLES) instead of switch-mesa
  20.1 and libdrm_nouveau; keeps symbols in uzdoom.elf, patches CHKFEAT/GCS in
  the stripped NRO copy (scripts/patch_chkfeat.py).
- Optional RDOOM_VK_TRACE diagnostic build logs Vulkan commands per submit.
- Loading screen rebranded; the separate nxlauncher NRO is no longer built.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
